18. /**
19.  * `dispense_status` belongs to the pharmacy. Only a dispense action sets it.
20.  * A new medication request must always start with an empty `dispense_status`,
21.  * even when the user copies it from a record that the pharmacy dispensed.
22.  *
23.  * Each test uses its own medication, so the tests can run in parallel against
24.  * the same patient and encounter.
25.  */
26. 
